// Wave 6 - L2CAP channel configuration and signal builders,
// 0x80212F34..0x80218624
//
// A child channel block extends the wave-5 layout with a local/remote channel
// id pair at +0x14/+0x16, a callback table pointer at +0x30, configuration
// flags at +0x34, the negotiated MTU at +0x3A and two 24-byte configuration
// option blocks at +0x40 and +0x58.
