/// Dispatches a vendor-specific HCI event to the registered handler.
///
/// Warns when the controller's manufacturer word is not `0x12`, clears the
/// vendor-command state (both [`BTM_VENDOR_CMD_CB`] and [`BTM_VENDOR_BUSY`]),
/// and forwards the event to [`BTM_VENDOR_EVENT_CB`] with the arguments
/// swapped.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_8020396C` at `0x8020396C` (152 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/8020396c_FUN_8020396c.c`
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `payload`: event parameters, passed to the callback second.
/// - `arg`: passed to the callback first. `// unknown:` the only caller in the
///   export passes one argument, so this value is not recoverable here.
