/// Clears the RFCOMM control flag and disconnects one DLC.
///
/// When `value` is non-zero it writes `0` to the RFCOMM-wide control flag,
/// asks the disconnect sender to emit the DLC teardown, and - unless the DLC
/// is already stopped (`+0x73`) - reports the port state change with
/// `(dlc, 0, 1)`.
