/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/80204b6c_FUN_80204b6c.c`
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `bd_addr`: six-byte Bluetooth address.
///
/// # Returns
/// Address of the record payload, or `0`.
///
/// # Side effects
/// May log the address above trace level `2`.
///
/// # Safety
/// `bd_addr` must be readable for six bytes.
///
/// # Confidence
