/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_80205FEC` at `0x80205FEC` (80 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/80205fec_FUN_80205fec.c`
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `index`: record index; not range-checked by the original.
///
/// # Returns
/// Nothing.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Zero-fills `0x22` bytes.
