/// Finds the connection control block (CCB) for a local channel id.
///
/// CCBs are ten `0x7C`-byte records at [`L2CAP_CCB_TABLE`], indexed by
/// `cid - 0x40`. A record counts as valid when its in-use byte is non-zero; when
/// `conn` is non-zero the record's owner at `+0x10` must equal it.
