/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/8020beac_FUN_8020beac.c`
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `cid`: L2CAP channel id.
/// - `params`: configuration block (`+0` flags, `+2` status, `+4` result,
///   `+0x20` closed flag).
