/// # Arguments
/// - `channel`: L2CAP channel block.
/// - `data`: payload bytes.
/// - `length`: payload length.
///
/// # Returns
/// Nothing.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Bumps the identifier, allocates a signal, copies the payload and submits it.
///
/// # Safety
