/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/80217a98_FUN_80217a98.c`
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `channel`: L2CAP channel block.
/// - `ident_arg`: echoed as the signal identifier.
/// - `data`: payload bytes.
/// - `length`: requested payload length.
///
/// # Returns
/// Nothing.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Allocates, copies and submits one signal; may log a buffer failure.
///
/// # Safety
