/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_8021962C` at `0x8021962C` (512 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/8021962c_FUN_8021962c.c`
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `chan`: channel block.
/// - `index`: channel index.
/// - `packet`: receive buffer with `u16` length at `+2`, `u16` payload offset
///   at `+4` and the payload at `+8 + offset`.
///
/// # Returns
/// Nothing.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Queues or frees `packet`, updates `+0x40`, may pass the frame to the data
/// callback, may defer the status to `+0x65`, calls [`fn_80219ff4`] and emits
/// two trace lines.
