/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/8021e9a8_FUN_8021e9a8.c`
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `port`: RFCOMM port block.
///
/// # Returns
/// Nothing.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Cancels a timer, writes `+0x68`, `+0x0D`, `+0x74`, `+0x10` and the channel
/// index table, may arm a timer or dispatch a DLC command, and calls
/// [`fn_80219a54`].
