/// Multiplexer entry for one received RLS (line status) frame.
///
/// The five status bits of the frame are expanded into the modem-status
/// descriptor used by the frame builders: DSR/DTR from bit `2`, RTS/CTS from
/// bit `3`, RI from bit `6` and the DCD pair from bit `7`, with the break bit
/// (frame byte `9` bit `1`) as the descriptor's fifth byte and the flow byte
/// at frame `+0xB` when the "break present" byte `+0xA` is set.
