/// report the status through [`fn_80219300`]. An indication sends the status
/// with [`fn_8021d460`], mirrors the flow bit at `+0x63` and, outside credit
/// mode, forwards a flow change through [`fn_8021982c`] before reporting it
/// with [`fn_80219188`].
