/// Merges two packet-type range descriptors.
///
/// The two descriptors are five `u16` fields; field `4` (byte `+8`) carries a
/// type/flags byte. A set `0x10` bit marks a "single" descriptor, and
/// otherwise the 3 x 3 table at [`SCO_RANGE_TABLE_802F7040`] decides whether the
/// first wins, the second wins, or the ranges are combined.
