/// Builds and submits an RFCOMM parameter-negotiation (PN) frame.
///
/// Allocates a two-class buffer, writes the ten-byte PN layout: `+4 = 0x0C`,
/// `+0x14 = 0x81 | (flag ? 2 : 0)`, `+0x15 = 0x11`, `+0x16 = dlci`,
/// `+0x17 = extra`, `+0x18 = default or 0`, `+0x1A = mtu` big-endian,
/// `+0x1D = credit` and `+2 = 10`, then submits it through [`fn_8021d0d8`].
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_8021D270` at `0x8021D270` (232 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/8021d270_FUN_8021d270.c`
///
