/// Latches the cursor offset and advances a palette object's level.
///
/// `context[0]` is the object and the `f32` at `context + 8` is the new cursor
/// offset. The body saves the old level `+0x30`, asks [`fn_8022df30`] for the
/// step, stores the offset at `+0x2C` and writes `old + step` back to `+0x30`.
/// It is the standalone form of the kind-`10` arm of [`fn_802293b0`], with a
