/// - Observed: `9421FFD0 stwu r1,-0x30(r1)`; `mflr r0`; `stw r0,0x34(r1)`;
///   `DBE10020 stfd f31,0x20(r1)`; `F3E10028 psq_st f31,0x28(r1),0,0`;
///   `DBC10010 stfd f30,0x10(r1)`; `F3C10018 psq_st f30,0x18(r1),0,0`;
///   `stw r31,0xC(r1)`; `lwz r31,0(r4)`; `C3C40008 lfs f30,8(r4)`;
///   `C3FF0030 lfs f31,0x30(r31)`; `mr r3,r31`; `bl 0x8022DF30`;
///   `D3DF002C stfs f30,0x2C(r31)`; `EC1F082A fadds f0,f31,f1`;
///   `D01F0030 stfs f0,0x30(r31)`; the mirrored `psq_l`/`lfd` restores;
///   epilogue; `4E800020 blr`.
/// - Decoder note: opcodes `60`/`56` around the frame are `psq_st`/`psq_l`
///   paired-single saves of `f31`/`f30`, not arithmetic. In `EC1F082A` the
///   `fadds` third operand is `FRB = (w>>11)&31 = 1`, so the source is `f1`.
///   `0x8022DF30` itself ends in `fadds f1,f0,f1`, i.e. it returns a *single*
