//
// - `0x8034CCA8`, 23 slots at `0x8034CCB0..0x8034CD0C` (92 bytes). The second
//   derived vtable of the 0x70-byte range-owning palette object; its base
//   table is `0x8034CC40` (array `0x8034CC48..0x8034CCA0`) and the two
