/// Returns the sign-extended high byte of the slot-17 cell entry.
///
/// Slot 16 of both [`VT_8034CE74`] and [`VT_8034CED0`] (word `0x8034CEBC` /
/// `0x8034CF18`). It dispatches through the object's own `+0x4C` word (slot
