/// - Extent: `0x8022BE10..0x8022BE54` (68 bytes, 17 instructions), ending on
///   the `0x8022BE50 bclr`; three zero words follow at
///   `0x8022BE54..0x8022BE60`.
/// - Table: slot 16 of both tables.
/// - Reach: vtable-only; the `bcctr` at `0x8022BE28` is the slot call.
/// - Observed: `lwz r12,0(r3)`; `lwz r12,0x4C(r12)`; `mtctr r12`;
///   `bcctr 20,0l`; `rlwinm r0,r3,16,16,31` (= `r3 >> 16`);
///   `sth r0,8(sp)`; `rlwinm r0,r3,24,24,31` (= `(r3 >> 8) & 0xFF`);
///   `stb r0,0xA(sp)`; `extsb r3,r3`.
///
