///   the `0x8022C108 bclr`; one zero word follows at `0x8022C10C`.
/// - Table: slot 19 of both tables.
/// - Reach: vtable-only.
/// - Observed: the same cache/search prologue; then
///   `lis r3,0x1` / `addi r0,r3,-1` / `subf r3,r4,r0` /
///   `subf r0,r0,r4` / `or r3,r0,r0` / `rlwinm r3,r0,1,31,31`, i.e. the
///   sign bit of `resolved - 0xFFFF`, so `1` exactly when the answer is not
///   `0xFFFF`.
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `object`: live palette-device record.
/// - `value`: tile value to test.
///
/// # Returns
/// `true` when the selection is not `0xFFFF`.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Updates the record's selector and index cache through [`b289_select`].
///
